# What `make deploy-tour` uploads to Cloud Build (S14, D-189). An allowlist: everything is
# left out unless named below. Without this file gcloud would follow .gitignore, which drops
# the tour's voice clips (kept out of git on purpose). Secrets never leave this machine.
/*
!/Dockerfile
!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/Readme.md
!/src/
!/workspaces/
/workspaces/*
!/workspaces/cloudco/
# The owner's Observability (D-196): eval catalog, golden cases, saved eval summaries only.
!/evals/
!/.agentic-harness/
/.agentic-harness/*
!/.agentic-harness/evals/
/.agentic-harness/evals/*/
/workspaces/cloudco/tasks/
/workspaces/cloudco/outbox/
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
